<title>USA: Business owners' biggest challenges.</title>
<headline>Business owners' biggest challenges.</headline>
<text>
<p>According to a survey by The Geneva Companies, of Irvine, Calif., the biggest challenges facing business owners are:</p>
<p>1. Employee issues.</p>
<p>2. Trying to grow the business</p>
<p>3. Keeping the business profitable</p>
<p>4. Meeting Federal and State regulations</p>
<p>5. Keeping up with technological advances</p>
<p>6. Providing employee benefits</p>
<p>7. Obtaining operating or growth capital</p>
<p>8. Dealing with vendors and suppliers.</p>
</text>
